---
import Page from "@/layouts/page.astro"
import { breadcrumbs } from "@/lib/schema"
import { REFUND_WINDOW_DAYS, SITE } from "@/lib/site"
---

<Page
  title="Contact Build with Abu | Support for Reel Studio Kit"
  description="Get support for Reel Studio Kit: lost downloads, duplicate payments and setup questions. Email hello@buildwithabu.xyz."
  path="/contact"
  kicker="contact"
  heading="Email is the fastest way"
  summary={`Write to ${SITE.email}. A real person reads every message.`}
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbs([{ name: "Contact", path: "/contact" }])]}
>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
  <h2>Lost your download?</h2>
  <p>Open your receipt from Dodo Payments and click <strong>Access in your customer portal</strong>. Your kit is under License Keys &amp; Downloads. You can also sign in at the <a href={SITE.portalUrl}>customer portal</a> with the email you paid with.</p>
  <h2>Charged twice?</h2>
  <p>
    Email us within {REFUND_WINDOW_DAYS} days with both payment IDs from your receipts, and the duplicate gets refunded. See the <a href="/legal/refunds">refund policy</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Stuck on setup?</h2>
  <p>
    Run <code>pnpm run doctor</code> first. It names the problem and the fix. If you're still stuck, send us its output.
  </p>
</Page>
